### `draft-ietf-regext-balance`: Balance Mapping for EPP
*Presentation: [EPP Balance Mapping](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-regext-epp-balance-mapping-00) by Dimitrios Bikos*

- **Updates**: Dimitrios Bikos presented updates incorporating feedback from Paweł Kowalski to support multiple balances per client on a server (e.g., per-TLD or per-customer balances).
- **Protocol Details**: Balance names are optional when a client has a single balance, but required and unique per server policy when multiple balances exist.
- **Status**: Feedback from registry operators is being requested; the draft is near WGLC readiness.

