### Structured Reliability Assessment Metadata
*Presentation: [RDAP Extension for Structured Reliability Assessment Metadata (draft-bertoldi-regext-rdap-reliability-scoring-05)](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-regext-rdap-extension-for-structured-reliability-assessment-metadata-draft-bertoldi-regext-rdap-reliability-scoring-05-00) by Simone Terreni*

- **Overview**: Simone Terreni presented work co-authored with Alexander Bertoldi regarding an extension to return third-party reliability scoring and assessment metadata in RDAP responses.
- **Options Evaluated**:
  1. Authoritative server returns the assessment envelope directly in the RDAP response.
  2. Authoritative server provides a link redirecting/referring to an external assessment service.
  3. Authoritative server uses a dedicated path segment (not pursued as it changes the query model).
- **Implementation & IANA**: An experimental server is live, and an IANA extension prefix was registered as an individual submission without asserting IETF consensus. The authors requested feedback on whether the working group is interested in adopting this work.

